{
  "id": "MAT.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 9",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida abitu damealga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwading'da maleambooda ak ghoaghaawa basooda ak ghwahita mujiineeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeassa siida abitu damealga nea geeyeana badayda bulaliida, hean dea Yesu masaweega nyaawa, gwayeesha siidida abitu damealgean, “Nung' gahoosan gurooroadaang'u Orjeedeanyu; sisamsa riing'eagaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi ng'oorshoodiga mwaatkwa aba jeesinga nyaawa, “Siisi goong'eawi ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwajeeng'u Yesu gidabaloolda saawa aba jeesinga nyaawa, ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda goobalooli ng'asheega munyas aba jeesingeagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea wusis aneeda gideaba geeyi, ‘Sisamseey riing'eagaagu,’ ghana eeyi, ‘Ng'eada ak guwi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geagasayi anala gideaba, Orjeeda Siida gwandeawa gheambalmeeda aba badayda ng'eanyiida jea gwasamsiina riing'eega”; ak gwayeesha siidida abitu damealgean, “Ng'eada, sareana muundaang'u ak guwi ghoah.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat siidida ak gawa gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah eemeeda siidida ghang'ut muuwda ak ghoaghaambiit ASEETA ghayi adaw buuneeda gheambalmeeda sunuun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gaguursa Matayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda ng'ataawa Yesu aba hoowa ghwadaah siisi siguura Matayo nea gwanda jeeda ghooriida siing'oonya gwaadi; gwayeesha, “Eani geeshteanyu.” Ghang'eat ak ghwaat geeshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea goopteada aba ghoah damanda agiischooda, deagheata ghwahidu fuga saang'a ang'oonyi gwaadi, ea fuga riing'eega ama hidu goobiitpiit sea Yesu ea giinealshoodigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Farisaayajeega, gwayeesha giinealangaaschi, “Anda giinealshoocheandeang'wa goombuuchi fuga ang'oonyi gwaadi ea fuga riing'eega?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy niny gwayeesha, “Fuga majeekcheewi magaseadayi meang'nyeanda, geaghus fuga miyeani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aweayeena ak ghoanaali geat ng'asheesu, ‘Geagasayi baydeayda nea mii haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda.’ Aba gideaba mwaawuni daguursa fuga doobiiweadi, ghaawunyi daguursa gea mideawa riing'eega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita giiluuldeaydeaba geaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay heeda Yesu giinealanga Yohana ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda aseasa ea Farisaayajeega geeluuldi geat, nea giinealangaagu ea mooluulda geat?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Fuga siguursa nyeangiida ghoamu gagutu heareega nea gwandeawa siida geeshi? Gwanda askwearjoojiga jea ghwahidu jea eegeandeawa siida geeshi jeenyaawa, aba damani gaygooluulda geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida jea ghawaasa weasteesh hang'da waas. Aba gideaba weasteesh gayghabwaash hang'dida waasiin ak abeeda gayghoahaada seawadeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara buuneeda mayiina difaayeeda miighwaheas jeeda ghadeatka woosi; iisihindunu gaygwanyara ghadeatka, ak gaweay difaayeeda, ak gameewa ghadeatka; buuneeda gwayiina difaayeeda miighwaheas jeeda ghadeatka eashish ak gabaseayu sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Huda siida haw ea Gatmooni waas weeleeda Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida rukuna ng'asheesuun, ghwahidu siisi haw bea eemeeda Yahudi ak gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Nimi hudeanyu ghamneawa. Beeni eeweaya iina geatindaang'u uhuudaanyi ak gaygwaduudu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Yesu ea giinealangaaschi ak ghwaat geeshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaan Gatmoanagi beardooschi miyeanda areemi foojeanda gweanyeew damaniyeenya gweadu geeshta ak ghawaasa weeleeda hang'daanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gwayi aba jeadaanyi, “Iyaawaaschi weeleeda hang'daanyi gaydaahaap.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasach ghaat Yesu ak ghwadaah ak gwayeesha, “Hudeanyu hoosana, niihaapnyi masaweega iimwaschaan.” Ghahaap gatmoodida aba damandida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Yesu jeedeaba gheedida bea sugoocheandean. Hean ghwadaah eemeeda saang'a mida gea ayeawda nea gagutu heareega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwayeesha, “Ang'amwana hiji, aba gideaba huda miighami gabeachi ruweanga.” Geebara reari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea siing'aamwa buuneeda hoowa, gawa Yesu jeeda ghooriida ak ghoang'waay geatinda huda ama ng'ata ghang'eat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageawiit iiteaba ng'asheanji aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiita seaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap fih iyeenya ng'oowi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Yesu hoowa nea damandida beawaan, ghwaat geeshta fih iyeenya ng'oowi, nea goojuur nea gwayeesha, “Orjeeda Dawdi eaniyean bwaydaneasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weah Yesu jeeda gheeda gamaseaw fugiga asiyeenya ng'oowiin ak ghoanyaash gideaba, “Ghoamwaschi gideaba ghaamuuschi daahaabeagwa?” Ghwasha saawa nea gwayeesha, “Geamwaschi Ng'utamiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghawaas gheanyanga nyaawa nea gwayeesha, “Aba giteena masaweegeagwa gagasa anyasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwajaada gheanyanga nyaawa. Ama ng'ata gwareekusa Yesu nea ghoang'waaniit, nea gwayeesha, “Adiidu goorukusi eara sih ng'asheanji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eatng'eat Saawa gaweay ak ghoabwaash iita Yesu fugeaba ng'eanyiita seaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida manda ghuuta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
